---
// Act Two — Logline. Prose verbatim from /docs/01.
---

<section class="logline">
  <div class="inner" data-reveal>
    <p class="meta logline__eyebrow">Logline</p>
    <p class="logline__text">
      Inside the billion-dollar world of international show jumping — where
      Olympic athletes, dynastic heirs, and the <em>horses that bind them</em>
      chase the sport’s ultimate prize across a year on the road to the 2028
      Los Angeles Games.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .logline {
    padding: var(--section-y) var(--gutter);
    background: var(--color-paper);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 70vh;
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 56rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .logline__eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .logline__text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 40, "WONK" 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2rem + 2.5vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .logline__text em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-variation-settings: "opsz" 144, "SOFT" 70, "WONK" 1;
    color: var(--color-bay);
  }
</style>
